<title>USA: Unit Instruments retains advisor.</title>
<headline>Unit Instruments retains advisor.</headline>
<dateline>YORBA LINDA, Calif. 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unit Instruments Inc said it has retained Needham &amp; Co to assist the company in evaluating strategic alternatives for maximizing shareholder value.</p>
<p>The company said these alternatives may include the sale or acquisition of the company.  It said other alternatives could include the formation of strategic alliances or joint ventures.</p>
